## 🔧 Advanced Usage

### Moving the VM

After importing, you can move the `.qcow2` file anywhere:

```bash
# Stop the VM
virsh shutdown debian11

# Move the file
mv debian11-miashs.qcow2 ~/VMs/

# Update the VM configuration
virsh edit debian11
# Change the <source file='...'> path to the new location
```

### Creating a Snapshot

```bash
# Create a snapshot before making changes
virsh snapshot-create-as debian11 snapshot1 "Before modifications"

# List snapshots
virsh snapshot-list debian11

# Revert to snapshot
virsh snapshot-revert debian11 snapshot1
```

